      "relation": "后期配套",
      "weight": 0.85,
      "content": "逆光片的后期核心是大幅提阴影，同时面对噪声代价。"
    },
    {
      "id": "e_bl_denoise",
      "from": "act_shadow_lift",
      "to": "cap_high_iso",
      "relation": "副作用",
      "weight": 0.8,
      "content": "大幅提阴影会把暗部噪声一并放大。"
    },
    {
      "id": "e_overcast_post",
      "from": "cap_overcast",
      "to": "tone_st_blackpoint",
      "relation": "后期配套",
      "weight": 0.85,
      "content": "阴天片发灰的第一处方是重定黑场。"
    }
  ]
